We’re building a web-based IPL Cricket Cards Game—a digital twist on the classic cricket card game. Players will be dealt a 5-card hand, choose a stat (like batting or bowling), and compete by comparing stats that have dynamic multipliers. These multipliers are determined by real or simulated IPL events
Orange Cap & Purple Cap: The best batsman and bowler get a 1.2× boost (with others in top 5 getting a 1.1× boost).
Top 4 Teams: Cards from teams in the top four get boosts from 1.4× down to 1.1× depending on their ranking.

